# Per-run scratch: the overlay root the suite writes, the JSONL logs it audits,
# traces and screenshots. Wiped and recreated by `harness/globalSetup.mjs` at the
# start of every run, so nothing here is ever evidence of anything.
#
# Committing an audit log is a DELIBERATE act: copy it out of `.artifacts/run/`
# into `docs/plans/evidence/` under a dated name, the way
# `proxy-log-reverify.jsonl` was. Never `git add -f` from here.
.artifacts/
